# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Šī { -brand-name-firefox } lejupielāde no { $partner } nav pieejama Tavā valodā. Joprojām vari lejupielādēt { -brand-name-firefox } ar zemāk esošo pogu.
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Šī { -brand-name-firefox } lejupielāde no { $partner } nav pieejama Tavai ierīcei. Joprojām vari lejupielādēt { -brand-name-firefox } ar zemāk esošo pogu.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = Tu jau izmanto { -brand-name-firefox }. Dodies uz firefox.com, lai redzētu, kas jauns!
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Doties uz firefox.com
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
